Luxurious Room
    This large chamber appears to be the residence of some wealthy, cultured
person. Tall bookshelves laden with tomes of all sizes rise to the ceiling,
ornate scupltures line shelves on the walls, and hanging tapestries depict
battles between angels and demons. A large canopied bed, massive oaken table,
and carved wooden chairs provide furnishing for this room. The scent of incense
pervades the air with its pungent smell. 
Also here: Dhelvanen.
Obvious exits: nEortheast
The room is dimly lit
[HP=53]:
ask dhelvanen about help
Dhelvanen says, "You could help me greatly by satisfying my instiable need
for revenge. If there is some way you could bring about the demise of that
cruel she-dragon, I would reward you with a powerful artifact of magic. Of
course, to slay her you would need a large party of extremely powerful
adventurers, no single person could possible hope to survive. Also, I could
reward you for fetching a few lesser things for me... for some of my more
powerful scrying techniques, I need the eye of a cyclops. And in for some of
the more delicate weavings I make, spider silk is invaluable. For either of
these things I would give you a lesser magic item. Good luck in your travels,
adventurer." He thinks for a second, and then says, "Oh yes... you will need
some sort of protection to survive in the extreme heat of the lava flow... if
you bring me the hide of a greater hellhound, i will be able to fashion an
amulet that will let you survive the temperature. Note that it will NOT
protect you from actual damage! But it WILL let you pass through the lava
area."

